Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 00:13:22 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1064/1259] Workspace locks in the Collection; the GPU memory
 presets go, Auto and Manual stay
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

HERESY 1070: right-click a workspace: Lock / Unlock Workspace Deletion, Lock / Unlock Tracks Deletion; a 🔒
beside its name; a locked take cannot be deleted for good either.
HERESY 1071: the page guessed a preset from the knobs, and 24 and 32 GB differed only by Keep models loaded,
so a 24 GB card showed 32 GB again; now Auto (fitted to the GPU found, keep-loaded stays yours) or Manual.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
